{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/993869-made-a-covenant-sorting-quiz","id":993869,"title":"Made a covenant sorting quiz.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-26T20:52:09-07:00","id":993869,"title":"Made a covenant sorting quiz.","content":"I hope this sort of thing is allowed. Basically you just answer the quiz in character and it will sort you into a covenant. <br /> <br /> Any additional questions you think I should add? <br /> Any questions I should remove or tweak? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://quiz.tryinteract.com/#/581140dda485031100ec5e5d\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://quiz.tryinteract.com/#/581140dda485031100ec5e5d\" target=\"_blank\"> Interact Quiz </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://quiz.tryinteract.com/#/581140dda485031100ec5e5d\" target=\"_blank\"> https://quiz.tryinteract.com/#/581140dda485031100ec5e5d </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1310-samare","name":"Samare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1310_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T20:57:23-07:00","id":993870,"title":"","content":"Ordo Dracul, to be expected since I'm a transhumanist <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T21:17:11-07:00","id":993877,"title":"","content":"It's fairly easy to simply answer according to whatever covenant you want. If you don't want it to be so obvious you might try posing the questions as hypothetical scenarios where specific answers point to the stereotypical traits of each covenant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T22:25:16-07:00","id":993895,"title":"","content":"That is a really good idea. Any suggestions on some hypothetical scenarios I could write in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1310-samare","name":"Samare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1310_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T06:52:28-07:00","id":994015,"title":"","content":"As mentioned above, these options are really really obvious, to a point where it's painful. I got Ordo Dracul as well, but I would in no way be an Ordo Dracul vampire if I was to be embraced. This should definitely have scenarios, with your approaches and things. &quot;Your buddy owes you money. He doesn't have it and is already late to bring it back. He comes in and asks you for a favor - even more money. What do you do? Give it to him. Not give it to him. Threaten him about the money he already owes.&quot;<br /> <br /> A good constraint to work with when designing such a quiz would be &quot;max 3 responses per question&quot;, that way, you can avoid the &quot;each answer corresponds easily to a covenant&quot; which makes it obvious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T15:38:53-07:00","id":994247,"title":"","content":"Sure it's obvious to us but for the average &quot;Which Covenant and why?&quot; poster, it should work just fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11661-rathamus","name":"Rathamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11661_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T15:51:21-07:00","id":994250,"title":"","content":"Its definitely a good start. All the problems of it being a bit too obvious have been mentioned already.<br /> <br /> And yes, I would agree, only do like 2 or 3 answers each question. Sometimes 2 of them might give you points to a certain covenant, while the 3rd is actually neutral and doesn't swing the vote one way or another. You'll have to be careful though that each covenant gets the same amount of points in the end (or you normalize the results, that works too)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2337-quatar","name":"Quatar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"269"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T20:41:57-07:00","id":994377,"title":"","content":"What awesome Material Samare<br /> I loved it.<br /> I understand and agree that the questionnaire may even be somewhat obvious, but assuming the person performs the Quiz with sincerity, and keeps focus on realize their affinities, the quiz works very well. I'm running a chronicle with new players on the Requiem Setting, whose proposal involves the characters being presented gradually to each covenant. So I'll definitely use your quiz to know where to start with each character. So thank you!<br /> <br /> By the way, I'm petrified by the result of my quiz. Despite my guesses, it seems that I was born to be a Invictus boy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11934-draugr","name":"Draugr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11934_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T22:00:54-07:00","id":994404,"title":"","content":"This is very cool! I had fun, so thanks for sharing (btw, Ordo Dracul of course)<br /> Especially for beginners, this is a great starting point. I'd agree that 3 answers per question/scenario might be an improvement. The Suggestion and your test itself reminded me of the (optional) Quiz In the beginning of Vampire the Masquerade Bloodlines. Might be worth a look for scenario inspiration.<br /> <br /> <br /> P.S.: You wouldn't happen to be interested and/or planning on doing something similar for the other splats? ^^&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}